means there's a more important project
that needs you.

864
00:53:24,510 --> 00:53:25,970
So you can't talk about it.

865
00:53:28,730 --> 00:53:29,720
I'll ask no more.

866
00:53:39,030 --> 00:53:40,320
If I go,

867
00:53:43,880 --> 00:53:46,210
we might not see each other
for a long time.

868
00:53:59,320 --> 00:54:00,510
Actually, I feel

869
00:54:01,670 --> 00:54:02,730
the same way you do.

870
00:54:04,320 --> 00:54:06,030
If this is what you want to do,

871
00:54:07,400 --> 00:54:08,530
